# Architecture

Linear Wald loop: generate → retrieve (critic only) → critique JSON → revise. No LangGraph/LangChain/DSPy.

- `domain/` — models only; no I/O
- `application/` — `WaldLoop`; ports only, no HTTP/YAML
- `adapters/` — LLM, store, CLI
- `prompts/` — prompt text only

The generator must never receive Non-Survivor Store hits. Critic output is validated `Critique` JSON. New features land in the matching layer or they do not land.

Do not put business logic in the CLI. Do not collapse draft+critic into one prompt. Same HTTP class may implement both LLM ports; calls stay separate (`generate` / `critique` / `revise`).
